@MilosKozak do you have any idea? Is there a possible way, that the new bluetooth boards causing these problems?
@TebbeUbben  maybe you have an idea, I guess you wrote the dash hotfix for android 16.

4 days ago I had different connection loop issue, pod is paired succesfully but aaps isn't able to connect or find the pod.
I was trapped in a connection loop. 

I have a screenrecord to show you what I meant. Yesterday I got the same issue again, but I was able to get the pod back to work, after disabling and enabling bluetooth a few times I finally recieved a pairing request which was successful after the fourth time. I think these issues are caused by the changed bluetooth boards. 

